{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788014295000-875a20", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "包装机的日常保养周期怎么安排比较合理？", "id": "4d5d6994827548f59ef09ba199b7598a", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:15", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "e33da909b9004314a493eb58e07c2300", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:15", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "2d512d7d598f4f41987ec5d25371eaa5", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:23", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:55"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**日/周/月三级保养**\n- 日：班前清洁+气源压力检查+光电传感器擦拭（10min）\n- 周：链条润滑、封刀检查、热电偶紧固\n- 月：传动皮带张力、轴承补脂、温控校准\n把保养表塑封挂在机台侧板，完成打勾。", "id": "0d3f3e9d8ab44098b7efab9180edbe27", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:23", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:55"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "285cfd6767b04144b45cf5078e03f791", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:23", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:38:55", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "封刀一般多久换一次？", "id": "c7b4bce769e84d9b8c3b3fd12f0533f6", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:15", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "1912372f252c4cf783775e32fc952478", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:15", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "4afccb1f3ba54b0aa5c3bd0c92bfa522", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:23", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:55"}, {"type": "text", "text": "正常两班制下约 **3–4 个月** 或累计 15 万封口次；出现封口发皱/粘刀就应提前换。建议每台机备 1 组，随易损件包走。", "id": "86e265c1c6bb4dd4b450af9c0c5db784", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:23", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:55"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "f9c1e74d017040759a731ef5e0cc01e1", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:23", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:41:55", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "保养表谁签字确认？", "id": "efbab48115134c1189155a8522c245cc", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:43:55", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "756e7961a7614759b94d8844e8c95f55", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:43:55", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "b3df8e37bfca456fb2debd8e22ed5cef", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:01", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:40"}, {"type": "text", "text": "操作工做日保养自签，班组长每周抽查签复核；月度保养由设备员执行、生产主管验收。签字留痕是设备追溯的底线，出了质量问题能倒查到保养记录。", "id": "5c30c77977934f7c87cae5172055bcac", "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:01", "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:40"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "e1271854c1894be3b34a7e33b09a5824", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:01", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-29T14:44:40", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}